Trace code-to-runtime evidence

Usage:
  eshu trace [command]

Available Commands:
  service     Trace how a service gets from source code to runtime

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for trace

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu trace [command] --help" for more information about a command.
